            <title>[IGNITE-3936] JDBC POJO store may load data twice in some conditions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3936</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If POJO class present and Binary marshaller configured then &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;cache.loadCache(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; may load same data twice.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also in case of empty table in database POJO store also tries to load data twice.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
